t. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_acli_field_coverage.py:1-22, 34-49, 181-196, 287-292, 331-352, 389-441, 465-470, 525-531, 561-566, 594-600, 642-650, 683-689, 719-724, 744-752` — Preserve exact ACLI payload/argv contracts, REST routing, sanitizer boundaries, and external citations. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_alert_display.py:1-32, 44-50, 114-116, 157-159, 218-220, 244-246, 304-306` — Preserve alert resolution and show/list projection contracts. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_fsck_binding_drift.py:1-9, 138-164, 191-194, 211-213, 416-418` — Preserve window absence is informational; only persisted confirmed-404 state establishes dangling drift. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_fsck_keyset_prev_heldout.py:169-180, 254-261` — Preserve payload-byte comparison versus logical ref-state comparison. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_fsck_repair.py:1-13` — Preserve exact audited-set pruning and the four pre-write guards. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/bridge/test_jira_capability_probe.py:77-79, 284-287, 300-311` — Preserve current import seam and logical retry schedule. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_acli_field_coverage.py tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_alert_display.py tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_fsck_binding_drift.py tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_fsck_keyset_prev_heldout.py tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_fsck_repair.py tests/scripts/bridge/test_jira_capability_probe.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_acli_field_coverage.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_alert_display.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_fsck_binding_drift.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_fsck_keyset_prev_heldout.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/bridge/test_bridge_fsck_repair.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/scripts/bridge/test_jira_capability_probe.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2d43-3c39-307e-4450"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2d43-3c39-307e-4450","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticke